{"ID":"20240314092334-lck432n","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092334-lck432n","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092334-lck432n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155454-hcagnpc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155454-1i86l0j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155454-hcagnpc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"【排脓汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422155520"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422155454-hcagnpc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-hcagnpc","updated":"20240422155520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"排脓散\u0026amp;排脓汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155454-uc5v6ob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-uc5v6ob","updated":"20240422155454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"排脓散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155454-gy2zy63","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-gy2zy63","updated":"20240422155454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实十六枚、芍药六分、桔梗二分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155454-pfo8vpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-pfo8vpr","updated":"20240422155454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，杵为散，取鸡子黄一枚，以药散与鸡黄相等，揉和令相得饮，和服之，日一服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155454-ba1ap63","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-ba1ap63","updated":"20240422155454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在开始介绍这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"排脓汤、排脓散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就有意思了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155454-zw1k00z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-zw1k00z","updated":"20240422155454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先第一个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"排脓散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实、芍药、桔梗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。处方呢，重用枳实，再来是芍药，再来是桔梗。这个排脓汤，我们是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用在胃化脓"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。当胃化脓的时候，跟肺脓疡不一样。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺化脓的时侯，病在肺上，一定会咳脓出来，咳嗽。胃里面化脓时，胃里面不会咳啊，要吐脓出来，白白的脓"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个脓就像你的伤口，你的青春痘挤个脓，就是那样子，那是脓出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155454-tt7ples","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-tt7ples","updated":"20240422155454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那因为是在胃上面，胃化脓了，所以我们用散，用粉剂。我在临床上治疗肝脓疡的时候，肝化脓。老师你怎么知道他肝化脓？诶前面讲过啦，手摸上去烫的，皮肤都是冷的，手摸上去是烫的，肝化脓了！化脓的时侯呢，处方还是这样子，加上了什么？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我们有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四逆散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有没有？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡、黄芩、枳实，还一个什么？炙甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以柴胡三钱、枳实三钱、黄芩三钱，炙甘草..."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白芍、桔梗、枳实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这三味药的排脓散呢，跟"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡、黄芩、甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"放在一起的时候，六碗水去煮二碗。治疗肝脓疡的时候，我们要用汤剂，那病人吃了以后就是排脓，大便会清出来很多脓疡。那这个你第一天摸到的时候，你就记得，这个手掌一摸上去，比如说在这个人的肝区，这个脓是很大一块，摸上去是烫的，两天以后变小了，精神越来越好起来，就代表脓在退嘛。脓都出来后就没有了，冷掉了嘛，就是好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155454-z3nj7qj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-z3nj7qj","updated":"20240422155454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个处方呢，还有一个地方也会用到。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胰脏发炎的时候也会用到"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那胰脏发炎的主要的症状，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肚脐...由肚脐的左侧，很偶尔也会看到右侧，左侧动悸，这个气会上冲胸口"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，心下痞，呕吐，心下痞胃里面难过啊，同时呢胃痛，腹部的胃痛得很厉害。那我们用的处方呢是苓桂甘枣汤，茯苓桂枝甘草大枣。苓桂甘枣汤治疗这种左侧气上冲心，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"加上枳实、芍药，桔梗排脓汤，那在治疗这个胰脏炎的时候，效果很好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155454-xe96iqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-xe96iqf","updated":"20240422155454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般来说你如果得到胰脏发炎，大概 15-20 年以后，可能得到胰脏癌的机会很大，那如果有这种病的时候，诸位用这个处方，这边不变（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"指排脓散用量"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），枳实五钱、芍药三钱、桔梗两钱，苓桂甘草汤的话，茯苓用五钱，桂枝用三钱，甘草二钱，那红枣十个，诸如此类的，要赶快把他治好。所以，绝对可以治好。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155454-supzz31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-supzz31","updated":"20240422155454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有呢，如果你看到同样症状是这样子，同样的处方，有病人呢？有的人是这个气上从左腹侧哦，动悸，气上冲心，也是里面化脓，也是有一样的汤剂，一样的汤方，内症可能是胆结石。所以我们看到刚才说痛有可能从右边痛上来，胆结石哦，也会有这现象。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以临床上看到病人的病是一回事，下手处方的时候又是另外一回事，以同症同治为主"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以这个时候我们要回头再去想我前面跟大家讲过的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，为什么老是看到枳实？食物的浊水出现的时候，都会用到枳实，所以枳实用在排脓的地方，用到很多。用在气停滞在里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155454-qdjmh4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-qdjmh4m","updated":"20240422155454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"排脓汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155454-jaomtmt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-jaomtmt","updated":"20240422155454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草二两桔梗三两生姜一两大枣十枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155454-hz3vvlt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-hz3vvlt","updated":"20240422155454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，以水三升，煮取一升，温服五合，日再服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155454-smsf1d7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-smsf1d7","updated":"20240422155454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接着下来呢，这个排脓汤大家看，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草二、桔梗三，这个生姜一、大枣"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"...这个就是桔梗甘枣汤，我们是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用在肺化脓的时候"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那因为痰饮很多，所以桔梗这味药呢，最重要是痰饮。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155454-air6pv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-air6pv8","updated":"20240422155454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说第一个当然很自然地想到是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺脓"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，肺化脓了。我们要用排脓汤。还有呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"喉癌"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，喉头里面生东西化脓，这个能排出来。第三个，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"舌癌"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，舌头里面的癌症，化脓烂掉了，也是用这个。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桔梗甘草汤这个处方做基础方，进行加减"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155454-1i86l0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155454-1i86l0j","updated":"20240422155454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你如果说这个人有舌癌，我们知道这个上焦痰就比较多嘛，我们就拿桔梗甘草汤对治。那胃口不好，你可以加些开脾胃的药，然后大便不顺，你可以开些利大便的药，这就可以了。这是两个不同的排脓汤。"}]}]}